        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We continued to sell Ohio Equipment Assets during the remainder of 2024, and based on these additional transactions, we conducted an impairment analysis at year-end on the remaining Ohio Equipment Assets that were held for sale, along with the Ohio Farm Site.",
